#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_email_traceability.view_move_list_email_failed
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_email_traceability.view_move_search_email_failed
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Remitente"

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_bank_statement_line__email_from_raw
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_move__email_from_raw
msgid ""
"Sender email exactly as received in the 'From' header, useful when the "
"contact could not be identified automatically."
msgstr ""
"Correo del remitente tal cual se recibió en la cabecera 'From', útil cuando "
"no se pudo identificar el contacto automáticamente."

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_bank_statement_line__email_issue_resolved
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_move__email_issue_resolved
msgid ""
"Set by the user once this move, originally received without an attachment, "
"has been completed or fixed manually. Once set, it no longer appears in the "
"Failed Invoices menu."
msgstr ""
"Lo marca el usuario cuando este asiento, recibido originalmente sin adjunto,"
" se ha completado o corregido manualmente. Una vez marcado, deja de aparecer"
" en el menú Facturas Falladas."

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_bank_statement_line__email_status
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_move__email_status
msgid ""
"Status of the traceability of the inbound email that originated this move."
msgstr ""
"Estado de la trazabilidad del correo entrante que originó este asiento."

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_failed
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_move__ocr_failed
msgid ""
"The attachment arrived correctly but the OCR/digitization process could not "
"be completed or was inconclusive. Only relevant when an invoice digitization"
" module (e.g. account_invoice_extract) is installed."
msgstr ""
"El adjunto llegó correctamente pero el proceso de OCR/digitalización no pudo"
" completarse o no fue concluyente. Solo es relevante cuando hay instalado un"
" módulo de digitalización de facturas (p. ej. account_invoice_extract)."

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_bank_statement_line__email_attachment_missing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_move__email_attachment_missing
msgid ""
"The source email did not carry any valid PDF/XML attachment to digitize. "
"This record was created only to keep track of the contact that wrote to the "
"journal alias."
msgstr ""
"El correo de origen no traía ningún adjunto PDF/XML válido para digitalizar."
" Este registro se creó únicamente para mantener la trazabilidad del contacto"
" que escribió al alias del diario."

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_email_traceability.view_move_form_email_traceability
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Deshacer"

#. module: account_move_email_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_email_traceability.field_account_journal__activity_user_id
msgid ""
"User who will receive the review activity when an email arrives on this "
"journal's alias without any PDF/XML attachment. If left empty, the activity "
"is assigned to whoever processes the email (usually the technical user of "
"the mail cron)."
msgstr ""
"Usuario que recibirá la actividad de revisión cuando llegue un correo al "
"alias de este diario sin ningún PDF/XML adjunto. Si se deja vacío, la "
"actividad queda asignada a quien procesa el correo (normalmente el usuario "
"técnico del cron de correo)."
